          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwo enkwi z'amahwa zibarabarukira omu kyoto,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tekeleza ebyo Ruhanga yatonzire,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'amakiro garashemeraga oshemelerwe, kagaratamaga otekeleze, amakiro agarungi n'agabi niwe yagataireho. Orw'ekyo omuntu taina kumanya bilimubaho mu maisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu burora bwange obu obutaina nshonga naboine buli kantu, haliho omurungi kufa akyali murungi, kandi haliho omubi kwikara ali mubi, mara akagira oburora burai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otaliba murungi okashagulirana, kandi otaliba mumanyi okarabyamu, otalija okeisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otaliba mubi okashagulirana, kandi otaliba mufera, otalija okafa otagobize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyekomye okutaba mubi okashagulirana n'okutaba mufera, aha rw'okuba omuntu atina Ruhanga ebyo abyelinda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omumanyi obumanyi bumuha amani, ashaga abatwazi ikumi omu kigo kimoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mazima omu nsi tabamu muntu murungi akora kurungi, atafakara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otalihuliliza buli kantu ak'abantu bagamba, otalilemwa okahulira omwiru wawe nakujuma, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okwo naiwe orajumire abandi emirundi nyingi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkakoza obumanyi omu kulebage ebintu ebi, nirwo nagambire nti, “Mbe mumanyi.” Kyonkai tinashoboire kuba ntyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obumanyi bulikaba kintuki nibuguma kububona, mara kintu kihango muno. N'ohai ow'okumanya mbali buli akabuzora? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo nkahindura ebitekelezo natekeleza nahenjuza, nahigiliza, nayebaza n'ebintu bingi, namanya n'akabi k'obufera, namanya n'okwo obufera liba iraru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabona ekiba kibi kushaga rufu, niwe mukazi alikushusha omutego, ebitekelezobye nibishusha ekitimba, n'emikonoye neshusha empingo. Omuntu ashemeleza Ruhanga airuka omukazi ogwo, kyonkai omufakare amugwaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwegesa nagamba ati, “Leba ekyo naboine, nkagenda nimbona ekintu kimoi kimoi, aho mpigire kumanya enshonga y'eki na kili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanabaire nkyahenjuza kyonkai ntakaboine kantu, nyija ngwamu omushaija omoi omurungi omu bantu rukumi, kyonkai omuli abo bonai omukazi tinamuboinemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabona ekintu kimoi kyonkai, niky'eki, Ruhanga akatonda abantu bali barungi, kyonkai bonene baija bakora agabo gangi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.7.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
